{
  "$schema": "./recipe-schema.json",
  "meta": {
    "schemaVersion": "3.1.0",
    "component": "story-gallery",
    "version": "1.1.1",
    "status": "stable",
    "tags": [
      "display",
      "gallery",
      "scroll",
      "cards"
    ],
    "links": {
      "figma": "",
      "storybook": "",
      "docs": "/docs/story-gallery-docs"
    },
    "changelog": [
      {
        "version": "1.1.1",
        "changes": [
          "Website-only-Klassen dokumentiert (Entscheidung 06.10.2026): .nc-story-gallery--nav-below (Twig-Klasse, kein CSS im DS) und .nc-shot* (Medien-Bauteil der Website aus neo-shot.js/neo-shot.css) als Website-only in den domNotes"
        ]
      },
      {
        "version": "1.1.0",
        "changes": [
          "Arena aus dem Recipe (RecipeArena, Plan v3, Phase 4, Gruppe bewegung): „Abspielen\" blaettert die Spur (scroll-behavior des DS)",
          "Anatomie: Slots aus dem geernteten Markup; .nc-story-gallery--nav-below und .nc-shot* (Website, nicht im DS) benannt",
          "Achsen navigation (below/overlay) und loop (nc-story-gallery--loop) mit Specimens navigation und loop"
        ]
      },
      {
        "version": "1.0.0",
        "changes": [
          "Horizontale Scroll-Gallery mit Caption-Cards (Apple-Style)."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "layer": "organism",
    "pipeline": {
      "scss": [],
      "story": "stories/organisms/story-gallery.stories.js",
      "arena": "apps/theme-configurator/src/components/laboratory/RecipeArena.vue",
      "drupal": [
        "block--block-content--neo-story-gallery.html.twig",
        "block--inline-block--neo-story-gallery.html.twig"
      ],
      "docs": null
    }
  },
  "anatomy": {
    "root": {
      "element": ".nc-story-gallery"
    },
    "slots": [
      {
        "name": "scroll",
        "element": ".nc-story-gallery__scroll",
        "optional": false
      },
      {
        "name": "track",
        "element": ".nc-story-gallery__track",
        "optional": false
      },
      {
        "name": "card",
        "element": ".nc-story-gallery__card",
        "optional": false
      },
      {
        "name": "media",
        "element": ".nc-story-gallery__media",
        "optional": false
      },
      {
        "name": "caption",
        "element": ".nc-story-gallery__caption",
        "optional": false
      },
      {
        "name": "title",
        "element": ".nc-story-gallery__title",
        "optional": false
      },
      {
        "name": "desc",
        "element": ".nc-story-gallery__desc",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "footer",
        "element": ".nc-story-gallery__footer",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "paddles",
        "element": ".nc-story-gallery__paddles",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "paddle",
        "element": ".nc-story-gallery__paddle",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "cursor-paddle",
        "element": ".nc-story-gallery__cursor-paddle",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "cursor-icon",
        "element": ".nc-story-gallery__cursor-icon",
        "optional": true
      }
    ],
    "convenience": [],
    "domNotes": [
      "Horizontale Scroll-Gallery mit Caption-Cards (Apple-Style).",
      "Markup wie data/markup/story-gallery.html (Website) und block--block-content--neo-story-gallery.html.twig: __footer mit den Paddles ist Geschwister der Galerie (navigation below), __paddles--overlay liegt in der Galerie.",
      "Website-only (kein CSS im DS, die Arena laesst sie weg): .nc-story-gallery--nav-below — setzt das Twig (block--…--neo-story-gallery.html.twig), wenn die Paddles unter der Galerie stehen; .nc-shot, .nc-shot--shadow, .nc-shot__* — Medien-Bauteil der Website (neo_fe js/neo-shot.js + css/neo-shot.css: Fokus-Crop und Praesentations-Presets im Medium). Ob nc-shot ins DS gehoert, ist offen (Bericht 06.10.2026).",
      "Blaettern: Paddles und Cursor-Paddle steuert neo-theme.js; die Bewegung der Spur ist scroll-behavior: smooth aus dem DS (bei prefers-reduced-motion: auto)."
    ]
  },
  "axes": {
    "variant": {
      "label": "Variant",
      "description": "Standard",
      "values": {
        "default": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [
            "layout",
            "title",
            "description",
            "paddles"
          ],
          "renderHint": "story-gallery-default"
        }
      }
    },
    "navigation": {
      "label": "Paddles",
      "description": "Lage der Blaetter-Knoepfe.",
      "values": {
        "below": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [
            "paddles"
          ],
          "description": "__footer > __paddles--below unter der Galerie"
        },
        "overlay": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [
            "paddles"
          ],
          "description": "__paddles--overlay ueber den Karten (unter 768 px ausgeblendet)"
        }
      }
    },
    "loop": {
      "label": "Endlos",
      "description": "Spur ohne Einzug, Cursor-Paddle statt Mauszeiger.",
      "values": {
        "off": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": []
        },
        "on": {
          "modifier": "nc-story-gallery--loop",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "paddles"
          ],
          "description": "Cursor-Paddle (.nc-story-gallery__cursor-paddle.is-visible) folgt der Maus"
        }
      }
    }
  },
